You may use modelsplit and the binaries in this release on your own computers, without charge,
for its free features: the demo, lean workers, single cards, the board and cost views, the
context engine, and the local dashboard without traces.

Board automation (board plan, board run all, board resume) and traces in the dashboard require an
active Revertgate subscription, with its licence key supplied in the environment variable
REVERTGATE_LICENSE_KEY. One subscription covers both Revertgate and modelsplit.

